You are getting garbage because NetHack uses ANSI codes for cursor positioning
and you don't have ANSI.SYS (or NNANSI.SYS, NANSI.SYS, ZANSI.SYS, DVANSI.SYS,
etc.) loaded.  Edit your CONFIG.SYS file to add the line:

  DEVICE=C:\DOS\ANSI.SYS

(edited to substitute the drive and directory where ANSI.SYS is located on
your system).  This should do the trick.
